  },
  "excerpt": "Another year, another Philly Tech Week. We love being a part of the city’s vibrant tech community, and a lot of O3 employees attended events last week. We were at Drupaldelphia, the Dev Conference, and Philly CHI’s Design Slam to name a few. Plenty of people were busy attending events, and a few were featured at different talks and panels.",
